            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.18.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 18:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, mwana w’umuntu, barira ab’ ubgoko bganyu, ut’ Ubugororotsi bg’umugororotsi ntibuzomukiza ku musi w’ibicumuro vyiwe, n’ivyaha vy’umunyavyaha ntibizomwicisha ku musi azohindukira akava mu vyaha vyiwe; yamar’ umugororotsi ntazoshobora kubeshwaho na bgo ku musi azocumurako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nabgira umugororotsi kw azobaho, akishimira ubugororotsi bgiwe, maz’ agakora ivy’ ukugabitanya; mu bikorwa vy’ubugororotsi bgiwe nta na kimwe kizokwibukwa, arikw ibigabitanyo vyiwe yakoze ni vyo azopfa azize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
