        {
          "text": "Maze mu mwaka ugira icumi na kabiri uhereye aho twambukaniwe tur’ inyagano, mu kwezi kw’ icumi, ku musi ugira gatanu w’ ukwo kwezi, haza umuntu acitse avuye i Yerusalemu, aranshikīra, at’ Igisagara caratsinzwe. ",
