              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, ubabarire, ut’ Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Ko murya inyama zitavuyemw’ amaraso, mukunamurira amaso ibigirwamana vyanyu, mukavisha amaraso: none mugira ngo mwohabga igihugu kw ishamvu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
