            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukw abe ari k’ uzobabgira, ut’ Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Ndahiye ukubaho kwanje, abasigaye mur’ ayo matongo ntibazobura guhindikiranywa n’inkota, n’ūri ku misozi nzomugabura mu bikōko bimurotse, kand’ abari mu bihome no mu masenga bazokwicwa n’ikīza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
