          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bazomenya yuko jewe nd’Uhoraho, igihe nzoba mmaze guhindura igihugu imisaka n’akajoreza, mbahōye ibizira vyabo vyose bākoze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.29",
