              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze baza kuri wewe nk’ ukw abantu basanzwe baza, bakicara imbere yawe nk’ah’ ar’ abantu banje, bakumviriza amajambo yawe, ariko ntibayakore: kuko berekanisha akanwa kabo urukundo rwinshi, yamar’ imitima yabo ikurikira ukwiyungukira kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
