              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi rāba, ubamerera nk’ indirimbo nziza cane y’ūfise ijwi ryiza, akaba ar’ umucuraranzi w’umuhinga: kuko bumviriza amajambo yawe, ariko ntibayakore. ",
